  "title": "Potato Cheese Soup",
  "description": "Vegetable broth is the base for this wonderful soup. And yes, there are lots of potatoes. Swiss cheese is added at the last minute, so that it gently melts into this hearty soup. Very, very good.",
  "authors": [
    "Marilyn Johnson"
  ],
